# DemoCraft Optional Cloud TTS Credentials Template
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECURITY RULES:
# 1. Copy this file to a gitignored `.env` or `.env.local` (run: chmod 600 .env.local).
# 2. NEVER commit your filled `.env` file to Git.
# 3. NEVER paste your API key directly into an AI chat window.
# 4. Uncomment ONLY the single provider you want to use, then pass:
#      python3 scripts/voice_router.py ... --env-file /path/to/.env.local
# 5. Want $0 offline voiceover or captions-only? You don't need ANY API key!
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Option 1: Google Gemini 3.8 TTS (recommended — expressive ES/EN commercial & tutorial styles)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy_REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_KEY

# Option 2: OpenAI TTS (gpt-4o-mini-tts — supports style instructions, pure stdlib REST)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_KEY

# Option 3: ElevenLabs (studio voices or cloned voice, pure stdlib REST)
# Note: ElevenLabs Free tier restricts Community Library voices via API;
# DemoCraft automatically falls back to premade multilingual voice `JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb` if HTTP 402 occurs.
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=sk_REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_KEY
# ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID=JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb
